id: pmc-native-tag-stability-337
title: Verify native tracker publication stability for issue 337
description: "Verification follow-up for the already delivered generator fix in PR #338. Keep the original issue delivery closed with its published upgrade action. Add real native tracker full/commit/tag/check regressions, dependency-only and item-bearing controls, no-git recorded-release generation, a disposable behavioral revert proof, and developer documentation. Original delivery: pmc-no-empty-unreleased-337."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
