author: codex-changelog337-1114
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T16:40:55.790Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"Main already contains the stable issue 337 generator rule from PR #338: omit every empty Unreleased section; include-empty retains versioned sections only. Added native temporary tracker publication matrix: 10/10 pass (empty, dependency-only, item-bearing git windows, each with both flags, and four no-git recorded-release cases). These assert pre/post-tag byte identity, package-version selection, dependency notes and completed_at ordering after a later comment. Disposable single-function revert proof passes: fixed 10/10, reverted 7 pass plus exactly 3 post-tag check failures, restored 10/10. Typecheck, build:test, build, docstring lint (59 files / 294 declarations), and diff whitespace checks pass. No runtime source, dist, pins, profiles or thresholds changed."
  "2026-11-14T16:40:56.906Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"Validation receipts retained in original item history: first broad coverage run timed out at 1200 seconds in existing lifecycle stress (pmc-lifecycle-test-budget). A narrower run passed 759/759 but missed two existing helper paths (99.73/99.57/100). Adding existing release-membership and renderer-drift suites measured generator coverage 100/100/100; 798/801 tests passed, with two catalog failures caused by the verification-only reopening of the delivered item, and one npm registry ETIMEDOUT installing @toon-format/toon. Restored the original published item through pinned pm restore; its prior completion timestamps, close reason, resolution and upgrade action are restored, with appended audit history retained. This follow-up stays active until orchestrator verification. Recheck the two catalog controls and package-install acceptance, then repeat the unchanged coverage command on the corrected tracker state."
  "2026-11-14T16:41:38.770Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"Recovery verification passes 3/3 with zero failures/skips/cancellations: node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"every rendering-change item has|package published prepend cleanup|^pm package install activates changelog command$\" test/check-generator-drift.test.ts test/generator.test.ts. Both original published catalog obligations are restored; package installation succeeds on isolated retry. The original item retains its exact prior closed_at, completed_at, release, close reason and resolution. Repeat the 801-test generator coverage command on this corrected tracker state; the verification task stays in_progress."
  "2026-11-14T16:53:21.989Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"Corrected tracker coverage run completed: generator.ts measures 100% lines / 100% branches / 100% functions at unchanged thresholds; 800/801 tests pass, zero skipped/canceled. The only failure is the existing pm package install activates changelog command fixture, whose isolated npm install again hit registry ETIMEDOUT for @toon-format/toon. That exact fixture and both corrected catalog controls passed 3/3 on the isolated recovery run. All dedicated publication cases and the revert proof pass. This broader local run is not a passing release gate because of the network failure; full unchanged npm/Bun release gates remain CI responsibilities. No runtime source changes or skipped tests were introduced to hide the failure."
  "2026-11-14T16:53:39.790Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"Final handoff preparation: native tracker matrix 10/10 and disposable revert proof 10 fixed / 3 expected failures / 10 restored pass; catalog and package-install recovery controls 3/3 pass. Typecheck, build:test, build, docstring lint and whitespace checks pass. The repository changelog generator and link-aware check pass. Generator source coverage is 100/100/100; broader local command remains 800/801 because of npm registry timeout, with unchanged tests/thresholds and no runtime patch. Shared-runner hold was honored and has cleared. Release only this verification claim, regenerate and check after this last tracker write, then commit and open a PR with Closes #337. Item remains in_progress; no review threads will be replied to, resolved or reacted to. Full CI verification remains pending."
  "2026-11-14T16:57:30.566Z",codex-changelog337-1114,"PR opened: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/pull/354 (Closes #337). Initial published implementation head: 08af34d946855be15b194f181aac287124ea2649. CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/43618244952 is queued at lifecycle; full Node 22/26 npm/Bun release jobs await lifecycle. CodeQL run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/43618244849 is queued. Latest-head checks are at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/pull/354/checks. Commit this receipt and check changelog consistency before the final exact-head CI observation; preserve the original 30-minute cutoff. Pending, skipped, neutral and missing checks or reviewers are not approval. Local generator coverage is 100/100/100, with the broader 800/801 npm-network limitation explicitly retained above. Work remains in_progress and unclaimed for orchestrator verification; no review-thread replies, resolutions or reactions were made."
